      "callEndedTimestamp": null,
      "isPinned": false,
      "content": "I'd still put a \"1\" in silk screen next to it.  There are so many other \"features\" ( triangle / logo ) that it could be confusing. Especially the triangle which is 180 deg appart and thus would allow to plug the board in reverse and the triangle is often used as pin 1 markers on CPU and such.",
