      "id": "1557295495171543151",
      "type": "Default",
      "timestamp": "2026-10-07T07:36:19.2+00:00",
      "timestampEdited": null,
      "callEndedTimestamp": null,
      "isPinned": false,
      "content": "Hmm, and if people are going to stick a standard 0.1\" header pin through it rather than just using it as a marker, 0.8mm hole is pretty tight.  Maybe should be 1mm hole?\n\nSo revised suggestion: 1.4mm size, 1mm hole, 1.2mm from the edge cut:",
      "author": {
        "id": "691780627338625077",
        "name": "rebelmike",
        "discriminator": "0000",
        "nickname": "RebelMike",
        "color": null,
